   "text": "ছি\" (I am at home) – 'তে' is the locative. Similarly, 'টাকায়' would be locative. Therefore, the answer might be D) অধিকরণে ৭মী. \n\nHowever, I'm still uncertain because some sources might say that the seventh case is used for instrumental. Let me check a reference. \n\nAccording to some Bengali grammar resources, the seventh case (সপ্তমী) is used for:\n\n1. Instrumental (করণে)\n2. Object (অপাদানে)\n3. Locative (অধিকরণে)\n\nSo, all three are possible. But how to determine which one applies here. \n\nIn the sentence 'টাকায় টাকা হয়', the phrase 'টাকায়' is functioning as an adverbial phrase. Adverbials can indicate manner, time, place, etc. If it's indicating the manner (by means of), it's instrumental. If it's indicating the place (in), it's locative. \n\nThe sentence seems to imply that the transformation happens through money, hence instrumental. For example, \"Money becomes money by means of money.\" So, the correct kārak would be করণে (instrumental), which is option B. \n\nAlternatively, if it's about the place where the transformation occurs, then it's locative (option D). \n\nBut without more context, it's challenging. However, in many similar sentences, the preposition 'য়' is used to indicate the locative. For instance, \"আমি ঘরে ঘরে বেড়াল\" (I walked around the house) – 'এ' is locative. But in this case, the preposition is 'য়', so 'টাকায়' would be locative. \n\nAnother example: \"বইয়ে খুব মজা হয়\" (It's fun reading books) – here 'বইয়ে' is the instrumental case (করণে). Wait, no. In that sentence, 'বইয়ে' is the instrumental case, meaning \"by reading books.\" So, that would be করণে (option B). \n\nSo, if 'টাকায়' is similar to 'বইয়ে', then it's the instrumental case. Hence, option B. \n\nBut earlier I thought it might be locative. This is confusing. \n\nWait, in the sentence \"বইয়ে খুব মজা হয়\", the preposition 'য়' is used with the noun 'বই' to indicate the means (instrumental), hence করণে. So, similarly, 'টাকায়' would be instrumental. \n\nTherefore, the correct answer is B) করণে ৭মB",
